---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import overlookPhoto from '../assets/gallery/fall-mountain-overlook.jpg';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Guided ATV Tours in Gorham, NH | Lemonski Tours"
  description="Book a personal guided ATV tour from Gorham, New Hampshire. Bring your own buggy or rent locally, then follow lifelong North Country rider Jay Leeman."
>
  <section class="page-head section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Gorham, New Hampshire</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Guided ATV tours in Gorham, NH</h1>
  </section>

  <article class="location-page section">
    <div class="location-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A more personal trail day</p>
      <h2>Rent in Gorham, then follow someone who knows the North Country.</h2>
      <p>Gorham gives visiting riders convenient access to the North Country trail network. A personal guide helps your group spend its limited trail time riding toward worthwhile scenery instead of worrying about every turn.</p>
      <p>You stay behind the wheel. Jay leads the ride, checks that everyone feels comfortable, and keeps your group together. First-time and experienced riders are welcome, and each tour is planned around your crew and current conditions.</p>
      <h3>Meeting your guide in Gorham</h3>
      <p>If you rent from <a href="https://northeastatvrentals.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Northeast ATV Rentals</a>, select that meeting option when you reserve your tour. Jay will meet your group at the rental location. Riders bringing their own legal, trail-ready machines can arrange another meeting place directly with Jay.</p>
      <ul class="location-facts">
        <li><strong>Tour length</strong><span>Three hours</span></li>
        <li><strong>Price</strong><span>$200 per group</span></li>
        <li><strong>Group size</strong><span>Large groups welcome</span></li>
        <li><strong>Included</strong><span>Local guide and photos along the way</span></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="location-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/book">Book a Gorham ATV tour <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/guide">Meet Jay <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Image src={overlookPhoto} width={1000} quality={76} alt="A North Country mountain overlook during fall foliage" loading="eager" />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
